#: src/gui-gtk4/uifiles/aavso_dialog.ui:130
msgid "Kname: "
msgstr ""

#: src/gui-gtk4/uifiles/aavso_dialog.ui:145
msgid ""
"Comparison star name or label such as the AUID (much preferred) or the chart "
"label for the comparison star used. If not present, use \"na\". Limit: 20 "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"使用した比較星の名称またはラベルを入力します。AUID（推奨）またはチャート上の"
"比較星ラベルを使用してください。値がない場合は \"na\" を入力します。最大 20 "
"文字まで。"

#: src/gui-gtk4/uifiles/aavso_dialog.ui:161
msgid ""
"Check star name or label such as the AUID (much preferred) or the chart "
"label for the check star. If not present, use \"na\". Limit: 20 characters."
msgstr ""
"チェック星の名称またはラベルを入力します。AUID（強く推奨）またはチャート上の"
"チェック星ラベルを使用できます。存在しない場合は \"na\" を使用してください。"
"最大 20 文字です。"

#: src/gui-gtk4/uifiles/aavso_dialog.ui:172
msgid "Starid: "
msgstr "Star ID: "

#: src/gui-gtk4/uifiles/aavso_dialog.ui:187
msgid ""
"The star's identifier. It can be the AAVSO Designation, the AAVSO Name, or "
"the AAVSO Unique Identifier, but NOT more than one of these. Limit: 30 "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"星の識別子です。AAVSO Designation、AAVSO Name、または AAVSO Unique "
"Identifier のいずれかを使用できますが、複数を同時に使用してはいけません。最"
"大 30 文字です。"

#: src/gui-gtk4/uifiles/aavso_dialog.ui:206
msgid ""
"The type of observation in the data file. It can be CCD, DSLR, PEP (for "
"Photoelectric Photometry). If absent, it is assumed to be CCD.  If you use a "
"CMOS camera please report it as CCD."
msgstr ""
"データファイルに記録されている観測方式を指定します。CCD、DSLR、PEP（光電測"
"光）のいずれかを使用できます。未記入の場合は CCD とみなされます。CMOS カメラ"
"を使用している場合も CCD として報告してください。"

#: src/gui-gtk4/uifiles/aavso_dialog.ui:216
msgid "Comparison star: "
msgstr "星を比較: "

#: src/gui-gtk4/uifiles/aavso_dialog.ui:226
msgid "The number of the comparison star."
msgstr "比較する星の数."

#: src/gui-gtk4/uifiles/aavso_dialog.ui:236
msgid "Cstd: "
msgstr ""

#: src/gui-gtk4/uifiles/aavso_dialog.ui:247
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The standardized magnitude for the variable is given by\n"
"\n"
"    Vstd = (Vins - Cins) + Cstd\n"
"\n"
"    where Vins is the instrumental magnitude of the variable, Cins is the "
"instrumental value of the comparison, and Cstd is the chart magnitude for "
"the comparison."
msgstr ""
"変光星の標準等級（Vstd）は、次の式で計算されます\n"
"\n"
"Vstd = (Vins - Cins) + Cstd\n"
"\n"
"Vins は変光星の器械等級、Cins は比較星の器械等級、Cstd は比較星のチャート等級"
"です。"

#: src/gui-gtk4/uifiles/aavso_dialog.ui:261
msgid "Check star: "
msgstr "比較星: "

#: src/gui-gtk4/uifiles/aavso_dialog.ui:271
msgid "The number of the check star."
msgstr "確認する星の数."

#: src/gui-gtk4/uifiles/aavso_dialog.ui:285
msgid ""
"Please use the sequence ID you will find written in Bold print near the top "
"of the photometry table in a sentence that reads \"Report this sequence as "
"[ID] in the chart field of your observation report.\" If you used your own "
"comparison stars (e.g. in the case of time-sensitive alerts when the "
"Sequence Team had no time to create a sequence), do not give a chart ID, "
"even if you plotted the chart using VSP. Use the comment code K (non-AAVSO "
"chart) and give a proper chart name like \"APASS DR10\". Then add "
"information on the comp stars in the notes. Limit: 20 characters."
msgstr ""

#: src/gui-gtk4/uifiles/aavso_dialog.ui:295
